{"title":"2006 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/3/553d2b3eb3b61e8aa2bd67b8374abd8ff811e0f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\sqrt{\\sqrt{9} + \\sqrt{1}})^{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"112\" height=\"35\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/4/ff417b986632d88127b2cde92182a347941f3d1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ \\sqrt{10} \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 10 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 16 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 82 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"458\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/5/89561b93e88f9bee91e8bb0c274eddcf0a26c1f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\sqrt{\\sqrt{9} + \\sqrt{1}})^{4} = (\\sqrt{3 + 1})^4 = (\\sqrt{4})^4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"283\" height=\"35\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/0/5600d34396f8caf552774565186f4732f6970a37.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=2^4 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(C) } 16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"126\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/3/c133847b35998b80a9c888dc3bdf9e86467ae320.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\sqrt{\\sqrt{9} + \\sqrt{1}})^{4} = (\\sqrt{9} + \\sqrt{1})^{4 \\times \\frac{1}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"248\" height=\"35\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/2/2d224e76671c568803f812970c93a59900ab99b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=4^2 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(C) } 16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"126\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fermat\" title=\"2006 CEMC Fermat\">2006 CEMC Fermat</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fermat_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 CEMC Fermat Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fermat_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 CEMC Fermat Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2006 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 5\">P